      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm absolutely on board with the idea of adding Parameters for Eye Look H and V. Even if code were simply added to the existing eye tracking code to push updates to those parameters that would be great. That way, you could still use the bone method if you wanted, but at the same time the parameters are still being updated, so if you need to adjust anything else using the parameters you could.\nIn my case, an avatar I've been commissioned to model has cartoony glasses - while he does have real eyeballs underneath, the glasses on top are supposed to be opaque with pupils on top. The ideal situation is to sync eye tracking between both, but that seems really difficult right now. I'll likely have to animate random movement by hand.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
